@title Cabinet plate: EMC Shields and Bonding layers (all round, pigtail, not connected rings; good bond outline)
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768
# Ctrl+K "EMC view on the plate" with Shields and Bonding on a galvanised plate: three screen ends told apart and a good bond in the earth colours.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-shields.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc view on the plate
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Indicative model"
shot plate-shields-default
check_layout
click_text "Bonding" #1
wait 15
shot plate-good-bond
check_layout
click_text "Shields" #1
wait 15
shot plate-shields-on
check_layout
# A short canvas starts the legend rolled up; opening it names the rings.
click 234 651
wait 10
expect "Cable screen ends"
expect "Ring with a cross"
expect "Earth and bonding"
shot plate-shields-legend-open
check_layout
click 234 351
wait 10
# Hot spots off and the panel folded: the ring on every device end is free to see.
click_text "Hot spots" #1
wait 10
click 1034 253
wait 10
shot plate-shields-rings
check_layout
click 1273 253
wait 10
# The light look.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 10
expect "Indicative model"
shot plate-shields-light
check_layout
